  "detail": null,
  "summary": "CRC outreach worklist \"Okafor CRC 2026\" (grp-okafor-crc, 4 members) worked per RBC-QM-02. Four items arrived after I started; all were reviewed and acted on, and nothing else is new.\n\n| Patient | Status | Reason |\n|---|---|---|\n| pt-0009 Elly Trantow (age 72) | Open gap: FIT kit ordered (sr-t0005), message sent (comm-t0006) | No qualifying screening on record. At first she looked excluded: Frailty entry plus active donepezil. Dr. Lin's message today (comm-00301) marked the Frailty entry (cond-00189) entered in error, and that exclusion requires frailty. No hospice or palliative care, nursing home, or colorectal cancer. |\n| pt-0020 Kelsie Rohan (age 52) | Excluded | Hospice episode (eoc-00002, finished), active 06/16 to 08/21/2026, for pancreatic cancer. The outside discharge summary (doc-00402) confirms it. She revoked hospice, but a finished episode in 2026 still excludes her. No order or contact. |\n| pt-0022 Tiny Koss (age 52) | Open gap: FIT kit ordered (sr-t0002), message sent (comm-t0004) | Her negative FIT (obs-01732) was corrected today: collected 12/31/2025, not 01/05/2026 (that was the lab's receipt date). Stool tests count by collection date, so it falls outside 2026. No other screening on record. |\n| pt-0024 Delaine MacGyver (age 51) | Open gap: FIT kit ordered (sr-t0001), message sent (comm-t0003) | Her 06/11/2024 sDNA-FIT (obs-01871) was withdrawn by Harbor Lab (doc-00401): the specimen was mislabelled, and the result is now entered in error. Her colonoscopy order (sr-00003, window 03 to 06/2025) is still active, but there's no record it was done, and an order doesn't count. No exclusions. |\n\n- **FIT orders:** all three run 10/23 to 12/31/2026. None of the three had an earlier FIT order.\n- **Patient messages:** each says the kit is coming by mail and explains how to complete and return it. Ms. Koss's message notes that her last FIT was negative and was collected 12/31/2025.\n- **Chart notes:** I signed one note per patient (doc-t0007 to t0010), citing RBC-QM-02.\n- **Inbox:** I closed the four arrival items (inbox-a0001 to a0004) and linked each to its order, message and note.\n- **Your call:** pt-0024's colonoscopy order (sr-00003) is still active though its window has passed. You may want to review it.\n- **Left open:** the other items in your inbox are outside this worklist, so I didn't touch them.",
